<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-SFE wheat futures seek direction, no trades.</title>
<headline>RTRS-SFE wheat futures seek direction, no trades.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>No trades took place in Australian wheat futures on the Sydney Futures Exchange on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Closing settlement prices, the mid-range value between bid and ask quotes, were also mostly steady.</p>
<p>Ed Scamps of Elders Risk Management Pty Ltd said with Chicago mixed, the Sydney market was looking for direction.  </p>
